graph TD
    Start([Start]) --> WifiStart[Start Wifi]
    WifiStart --> InitAllSensors["Initialize all i2c sensors (BMP280, Body temperature, real time clock) and initialize gas ADC"]
    InitAllSensors --> ConnectToBroker[Connect to MQTT broker]
    ConnectToBroker --> WhileTrue{While True}
    WhileTrue -- False --> End([End])
    WhileTrue -- True --> ReadSensor["Read all sensors, compute all values (as seen in other tasks)"]
    ReadSensor --> SendDataToBroker[Send data to MQTT Broker]
    SendDataToBroker --> Wait[Wait n seconds]
    Wait --> WhileTrue
